{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"1813d263c26e831c2567d2bb1a86aceeba0ff4bca2eb75bd8e33b93483b09179","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你趁着年幼、衰敗的日子尚未來到，就是你所說，我毫無喜樂的那些年日未曾臨近之先，當記念造你的主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要等到日頭、光明、月亮、星宿變為黑暗，雨後雲彩反回，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["看守房屋的發顫，有力的屈身，推磨的稀少就止息，從窗戶往外看的都昏暗；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["街門關閉，推磨的響聲微小，雀鳥一叫，人就起來，唱歌的女子也都衰微。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["人怕高處，路上有驚慌，杏樹開花，蚱蜢成為重擔，人所願的也都廢掉；因為人歸他永遠的家，弔喪的在街上往來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["銀鍊折斷，金罐破裂，瓶子在泉旁損壞，水輪在井口破爛，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["塵土仍歸於地，靈仍歸於賜靈的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["傳道者說：「虛空的虛空，凡事都是虛空。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["結論"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["再者，傳道者因有智慧，仍將知識教訓眾人；又默想，又考查，又陳說許多箴言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["傳道者專心尋求可喜悅的言語，是憑正直寫的誠實話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["智慧人的言語好像刺棍；會中之師的言語又像釘穩的釘子，都是一個牧者所賜的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我兒，還有一層，你當受勸戒：著書多，沒有窮盡；讀書多，身體疲倦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["這些事都已聽見了，總意就是：敬畏上帝，謹守他的誡命，這是人所當盡的本分",{"noteId":8},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因為人所做的事，連一切隱藏的事，無論是善是惡，上帝都必審問。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：這是眾人的本分","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}